                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I saw a recommendation on social media from a customer who had eaten there. I checked the menu first and decided to try it out. I ate there two days (December 9th and 10th), both times ordering the platter series. On the first day, since it was my first time, I didn\u0027t think to take a picture and ordered dish number 3 (the stir-fried mushrooms were delicious). On the second day, I ordered dish number 4. Everything was delicious, but the most amazing thing was the chicken strips – two for only $25! This is such a great deal! (Seriously!) The restaurant is comfortable and bright. I\u0027ll definitely go back.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "因為在社群看到有客人去吃而推播點到\n先看了看菜單 覺得先去吃吃看\n連吃兩天（12/9/和12/10）\n都是吃拼盤系列\n第一天因為第一次去沒有想到要拍張照\n點了3號餐（炒的菇菇很美味好吃）\n第二天點4號餐\n整體都很好吃最驚艷的是雞柳條2條才$25\n這個點心價格也太佛了吧！（很認真）\n店內環境舒適明亮 會再回訪",
